          },
          {
            "text": "Blend the Curry Paste",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Remove the fish and separate the meat from the bones. Discard the skin and bones.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Strain the broth and keep the liquid for later.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Blend the boiled herbs into a smooth paste, adding kaffir lime zest and shrimp paste while blending.",
